---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | ASF Law">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-[#0A0F1D] text-white selection:bg-[#c5a880] selection:text-[#0A0F1D] pb-16 font-sans">
    <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-4xl flex-grow">
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#c5a880]/10 pb-6">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white font-serif">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <a href="/" class="text-[#c5a880] hover:underline font-medium text-sm">← Back to Home</a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#12192c] border border-[#c5a880]/15 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-xl space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base">
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: January 2026</p>

        <p>
          At <strong class="text-white font-bold">Ahsan Shahzad Firm PC (ASF Law)</strong>, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any personal data you share with us. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information when you visit our website or inquire about our intellectual property legal services.
        </p>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#c5a880]">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong class="text-white font-bold">Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, company name, and details provided when using our contact forms.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white font-bold">Usage Data:</strong> Non-personally identifiable browser and network information gathered via server logs.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#c5a880]">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>
            We use the information collected solely to respond to inquiries, evaluate patent and trademark consultations, and maintain website security. We never sell or distribute your personal information to third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#c5a880]">3. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            For any privacy inquiries, please contact Ahsan Shahzad Firm PC at <a href="mailto:contact@asf.law" class="text-[#c5a880] underline font-semibold">contact@asf.law</a> or 1500 NW Bethany Blvd., Suite 200 Beaverton, OR 97006.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
